      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA CAVIAR (1) is a last start placegetter in a Grade 5, overcoming a collision in the run to finish a 4 length second over 488m at Mandurah. Returns to a course where she has performed well. Has the ability and looks hard to top. TWIN FIN (2) is an honest type in the frame at 10 of 20 starts including five wins, the latest scoring (27.30) over 488m at Mandurah. Has a strong winning record here at this journey. Super consistent and can feature with the right run. GREAT CHAT (3) was prominent throughout when winning two back but could manage only midfield last time when 6th and beaten 17 lengths at Mandurah (28.08). Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Cannot be underestimated. TARAWI LOCK (7) recorded a nose win (29.72) in a Free For All last time at Northam. Has five wins already from this draw.",
